{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Massimale 是一款隨身健身訓練日誌，適合到健身房訓練、希望每組重量與次數都有紀錄可查的人。它把訓練計劃、組數、負重與進度集中在同一個介面，並強調資料只保存在 iPhone 上，可選擇私人 iCloud 備份，沒有帳號、沒有廣告、沒有訂閱。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>訓練計劃與進度一站掌握</h2>\n<p>開啟今日頁面即可一覽本週安排，一按即開始當天訓練。計劃可設定組數、次數或計時項目，並記錄重量、休息與備註，按星期編排。動作庫附插圖及逐步指引，也可自訂動作。訓練時逐組記錄重量與次數，數值沿用計劃及上次表現，並設休息計時。身體數據與歷史紀錄同樣以圖表呈現。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-69-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-70-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-71-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-72-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-73-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-74-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Massimale</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T09:39:05.672531+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}